  "analyzerUploadBody": "{noun, select, cv{Upload a PDF CV to check for formatting that applicant tracking software commonly misreads} resume{Upload a PDF résumé to check for formatting that applicant tracking software commonly misreads} other{Upload a PDF document to check for formatting that applicant tracking software commonly misreads}} — missing text layers, multi-column layouts, garbled characters, and more. Nothing leaves your browser.",
