  "regionLatamLetterConvention3": "A photograph, date of birth, marital status, and national ID number (CURP/RFC, Cédula) are common at domestic firms, and deliberately excluded by multinationals and their local subsidiaries. Match the employer, not the country. CVForge renders a photograph when the template supports one; it has no field for the rest.",
